                "widgetType": "text",
                "settings": {
                  "html": "<p><strong>Jasefly</strong> is an open-source <strong>AI-first modular PHP framework</strong> by <strong>IIA3UK</strong>. It unifies a modern PHP backend, React frontend, visual Builder, Platform SDK, Access Layer, MCP tooling, and ZIP module runtime — so you can build real web products on shared hosting without a closed constructor lock-in.</p><p>The admin CMS is part of the platform. It is not the definition of the product.</p>",
